# Lista de inclusão: tudo fica fora do .vsix, exceto o que a extensão usa.
**

!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!assets/icon.png

# Temas de cores (gerados por npm run build)
!themes/*.json

# Ícones de arquivo
!icons/lucide/theme.json
!icons/lucide/LICENSE
!icons/lucide/dark/*.svg
!icons/lucide/light/*.svg
!icons/themed/*/theme.json
!icons/themed/*/images/*.svg
!icons/catppuccin/*/theme.json
!icons/catppuccin/*/icons/**
!icons/catppuccin/LICENSE
!icons/symbols-dist/symbol-icon-theme.json
!icons/symbols-dist/icons/**
!icons/symbols-dist/LICENSE

# Ícones de produto
!icons/fluent/theme/**
!icons/fluent/LICENSE
